  "details": "While in any avatar 2.0 playing an emote through the expression menu and closing it causes the text to have an box outline around the letters.\nNote the avatar 2.0 model must have custom emote or else it wont work.\nSteps to reproduce:\nGet in any avatar 2.0 model that has custom emotes\nPlay an emote through the expression menu (testing with an emote that loops is better)\nAfter clicking on the emote close the action menu and reopen it.\nTo reproduce this without an custom emote that loops:\nClick on an emote\nclose action menu\nwait for the emote to finish then reopen the action menu",
